Without marshalling, every wrapper operation is 1.5 or more times faster. 
Page clean-up, line removal, and other manupulatiosn are also slightly faster.  
ImageSharp was almost twice as fast at despeckling but had a 23% loss in content 
pixels. DFP uses a slower but less aggressive approach. Likewise, line removal 
in DFP handles color drop which this comparison doesn't account for. 

